WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:16.290
If all the salt in the sea were spread evenly
over the land, it would be 500 feet thick.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:21.949
The boa constrictor is the only living animal
whose common name is exactly the same as its

00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:23.790
scientific name.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:29.440
The eruption of Krakatoa in 1883 was the loudest
sound in recorded history.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:33.350
It was heard 3,000 miles away in Mauritius.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:38.449
St Vitus is the patron saint of oversleeping.

00:00:38.449 --> 00:00:44.530
Gerbils can smell adrenaline and are sometimes
installed in airport security areas to detect

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.980
terrorists.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.460
The citizens of Kuwait celebrated the end
of the first Gulf War by firing weapons into

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.460
the air.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:57.609
20 Kuwaitis died as a result of bullets falling
from the sky.

00:00:57.609 --> 00:01:01.999
On average, most people have fewer friends
than their friends have.

00:01:01.999 --> 00:01:05.330
This is known as the 'friendship paradox'.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:11.600
There are more than three times as many PR
staff in America as there are journalists.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:16.940
Under the Wildlife and Countryside Act, it
is explicitly illegal in Britain to use a

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.970
machine gun to kill a hedgehog.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:26.960
A snowflake that falls on a glacier in central
Greenland can take 200,000 years to reach

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.820
the sea.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:36.060
There are estimated to be approximately 41,000
different Christian denominations in the world.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:41.560
New York City drifts about one inch away from
Europe every year.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:47.880
In 1969, Apollo 11 returned from the Moon
in half the time it took to get from Boston

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:52.270
to New York by stagecoach in 1769.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:02:00.890
Between 1960 and 1977, the secret number authorising
US presidents to launch nuclear missiles was

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:04.630
00000000.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:12.209
The highest scoring word in Scrabble is oxyphenbutazone,
potentially earning 1,178 points.

00:02:12.209 --> 00:02:15.849
It is a drug used to treat arthritis.

00:02:15.849 --> 00:02:23.099
And finally, A coal-fired power station puts
100 times more radiation into the air than

00:02:23.099 --> 00:02:29.950
a nuclear power plant producing the same amount
of energy.

